msgid ""
"Click :download:`here <dl/CMUcam4GUI.zip>` to download the source code for "
"the CMUcam4GUI."
msgstr ""
"انقر :download:`هنا <dl/CMUcam4GUI.zip>` لتنزيل الكود المصدري لـ CMUcam4GUI."

